    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## 2 \u2014 ROUTAGE QUEUE\n**IF Queue Saturated?** \u2192 si flag `_queue_saturated`\n  \u2192 `true` : alerte Slack \u00e9quipe\n\n**SplitInBatches \u2014 Per Alert**\nTraite **1 alerte \u00e0 la fois** via loop-back.\n\u26a0\ufe0f Le loop-back peut ramener des r\u00e9ponses Supabase\n   ou des error-bubbles \u2192 filtr\u00e9s par la garde Section 3.\n",
        "height": 170,
        "width": 420,
        "color": 4
      },
      "id": "363eb66e-c54c-47cc-86f5-2422ed9010d9",
      "name": "Sticky Note",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        -528,
        -32
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## 3 \u2014 CONTEXTE ALERTE \u26a0\ufe0f (lecture obligatoire)\n\n**Code \u2014 Init Alert Context** est la garde centrale du workflow.\n\n### Garde anti-boucle infinie\n```\nif (item.error)               return [];  // error-bubble Continue on Fail\nif (item._queue_saturated)    return [];  // sentinel Check Queue\nif (!alertId || !item.rule_id\n    || item.status !== 'pending') return [];  // r\u00e9ponse Supabase loop-back\n```\nSans cette garde \u2192 `Supabase Mark Done` retourne la ligne mise \u00e0 jour\n(status='done') dans SplitInBatches \u2192 trait\u00e9e comme nouvelle alerte \u2192 **boucle infinie de 60+ it\u00e9rations**.\n\n### Pattern sd.currentAlert\nL'alerte est stock\u00e9e dans `$getWorkflowStaticData('global').currentAlert`.\nTous les Code nodes en aval lisent depuis `sd.currentAlert`, **pas** depuis\n`$input.first().json` (Supabase Mark Processing retourne un stream HTTP brut,\npas les donn\u00e9es de l'alerte).\n",
        "height": 360,
        "width": 660,
        "color": 5
      },
      "id": "1253d05d-908d-4d14-9cb0-7435404d813c",
      "name": "Sticky Note",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        160,
        0
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## 4 \u2014 CHEMIN SANS IOC\nL'alerte n'a pas d'IOCs \u00e0 enrichir.\n\u2192 **Code \u2014 Build No-IOC Message** lit l'alerte via `sd.currentAlert`\n\u2192 Formate avec pr\u00e9fixe `[LOW/MEDIUM/HIGH/CRITICAL]` selon `rule_level`\n\u2192 **Discord** : envoi du message format\u00e9\n\u2192 **Supabase** : `status = 'done'`\n",
        "height": 170,
        "width": 620,
        "color": 2
      },
      "id": "dd97ebed-6476-49f5-b0dc-53e21d09eeaf",
      "name": "Sticky Note",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        848,
        0
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## 5 \u2014 BOUCLE D'ENRICHISSEMENT IOC\n**SplitInBatches \u2014 Per IOC** traite chaque IOC un par un (IP / hash / domaine).\n",
        "height": 640,
        "width": 1560,
        "color": 4
      },
      "id": "b4211d92-c4a7-4a7c-acb3-7346e07f6b1f",
      "name": "Sticky Note",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        848,
        464
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "**VT Rate Limit Guard** \u2192 pause de 15s entre chaque appel VirusTotal (quota gratuit : 4 req/min).\nL'IOC courant est sauvegard\u00e9 dans `sd.currentIoc` pour les Format nodes.\n\n**Routage par type :**\n`ip`     \u2192 VirusTotal IP + AbuseIPDB   \u2192 `Format IP Result`   (verdict si malicious > 5 OU abuse > 50%)\n`hash`   \u2192 VirusTotal Hash + MalwareBazaar \u2192 `Format Hash Result`  (verdict si malicious > 5 OU trouv\u00e9 MB)\n`domain` \u2192 VirusTotal Domain             \u2192 `Format Domain Result` (verdict si malicious > 5)\n\n**Verdicts possibles :** `CLEAN` \u00b7 `SUSPICIOUS` \u00b7 `MALICIOUS` \u00b7 `UNKNOWN` (si API en erreur)\nLes r\u00e9sultats s'accumulent dans `sd.enrichedIocs[]` via `$getWorkflowStaticData('global')`.\n\n\u26a0\ufe0f Les Format nodes lisent via `$items('HTTP \u2014 VT IP')` etc., **pas** via `$input`.\n   Ils g\u00e8rent `vt.error` \u2192 verdict `UNKNOWN` au lieu de faux `CLEAN`.\n",
        "height": 550,
        "width": 1550
      },
      "id": "9657ae8a-df94-4abf-bcb4-cb4b8c737ba9",
      "name": "Sticky Note",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        848,
        512
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## 6 \u2014 OUTPUT FINAL (avec IOC)\n**Code \u2014 Build Slack Message** :\n- Lit `sd.currentAlert` + `sd.enrichedIocs`\n- Vide `sd` apr\u00e8s usage (\u00e9vite donn\u00e9es p\u00e9rim\u00e9es au cycle suivant)\n- Bail-out si `alert.id` absent \u2192 `{ _skipped: true }`\n\n\u2192 **Slack** : message enrichi avec verdicts IOC\n\u2192 **Supabase** : `status = 'done'`\n",
        "height": 230,
        "width": 660,
        "color": 2
      },
      "id": "312a61a1-5339-4dcf-b944-370a5719c9fa",
      "name": "Sticky Note",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
