      "parameters": {
        "content": "## 1 \u2014 INTAKE & NETTOYAGE\nCycle toutes les 30s :\n1. **Stuck Job Cleanup** \u2192 reset les alertes bloqu\u00e9es en `status='processing'` depuis > 5 min\n2. **Fetch Pending Alerts** \u2192 SELECT * WHERE status = 'pending' ORDER BY created_at\n3. **Check Queue** \u2192 filtre les items sans `id`, limite \u00e0 **5 alertes/cycle**, flag `_queue_saturated` si > 50\n",
